<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia house starts fall 7.3 pct in Q3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia house starts fall 7.3 pct in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian dwelling unit building commencements fell 7.3 percent in the September quarter over the June quarter to 28,361 for a year-on-year fall of 12.4 percent, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Economists median forecasts had been for a 0.1 percent rise in starts for the September quarter.  </p>
<p>Australian housing starts, Sept qtr-</p>
<p>    Private Sector:			s/adj	  orig</p>
<p>    Houses				   19,362	 20,122</p>
<p>    Total private residential	  27,188	 28,499</p>
<p>    Total new houses		     19,717	 20,437</p>
<p>    Total residential		    28,361	 29,993</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
